(38, 0, '2026-09-30 12:46:10', '2026-09-30 07:16:10', '<h1>Find your place in the hills</h1>		<p>Homes, villas, plots and commercial property across Dehradun, Mussoorie, Rishikesh and beyond, with honest advice from people who know the area.</p>[rec_search]			<h2>Featured properties</h2>		<p>Hand-picked listings we recommend right now.</p>[rec_properties count=\"6\" featured=\"1\"]								<a href=\"http://localhost/realestate/properties/\">\n									View all properties\n					</a>\n									<h2>Browse by location</h2>		<p>Explore what is available in the town you have in mind.</p>[rec_locations]			<h2>Why buy with us</h2>							\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288 0c-69.59 0-126 56.41-126 126 0 56.26 82.35 158.8 113.9 196.02 6.39 7.54 17.82 7.54 24.2 0C331.65 284.8 414 182.26 414 126 414 56.41 357.59 0 288 0zm0 168c-23.2 0-42-18.8-42-42s18.8-42 42-42 42 18.8 42 42-18.8 42-42 42zM20.12 215.95A32.006 32.006 0 0 0 0 245.66v250.32c0 11.32 11.43 19.06 21.94 14.86L160 448V214.92c-8.84-15.98-16.07-31.54-21.25-46.42L20.12 215.95zM288 359.67c-14.07 0-27.38-6.18-36.51-16.96-19.66-23.2-40.57-49.62-59.49-76.72v182l192 64V266c-18.92 27.09-39.82 53.52-59.49 76.72-9.13 10.77-22.44 16.95-36.51 16.95zm266.06-198.51L416 224v288l139.88-55.95A31.996 31.996 0 0 0 576 426.34V176.02c0-11.32-11.43-19.06-21.94-14.86z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Local knowledge						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						We live and work here, so we know the neighbourhoods, roads, water supply and future plans for each area.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M218.17 424.14c-2.95-5.92-8.09-6.52-10.17-6.52s-7.22.59-10.02 6.19l-7.67 15.34c-6.37 12.78-25.03 11.37-29.48-2.09L144 386.59l-10.61 31.88c-5.89 17.66-22.38 29.53-41 29.53H80c-8.84 0-16-7.16-16-16s7.16-16 16-16h12.39c4.83 0 9.11-3.08 10.64-7.66l18.19-54.64c3.3-9.81 12.44-16.41 22.78-16.41s19.48 6.59 